WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Meet LUMI 26.5: Agent Swarm and The Legion.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.200
Single-stream coding agents hit a wall on complex systems.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.500
LUMI transforms one prompt into an autonomous, multi-agent engineering organization,

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.800
combining Hierarchical Defer & Resume, Critical Completion Review, and The Legion specialist engine.

5
00:00:19.042 --> 00:00:22.242
At the center is the Orchestrator Conductor.

6
00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:28.842
Using the auto-approved engage_swarm tool, the conductor classifies your objective across 10 specialist archetypes

7
00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:35.542
and dispatches dependency-ordered DAG stages: Lead & Recon, Parallel Execution, and Verification & Hardening.

8
00:00:35.742 --> 00:00:41.642
Real-time progress cards stream into chat while strict file-reservation partitioning prevents edit collisions.

9
00:00:41.942 --> 00:00:46.742
Under the hood, Phases 8 through 10 deliver rock-solid execution resilience.

10
00:00:46.942 --> 00:00:53.142
A state-machine JSON root parser deduplicates streaming tool snapshots and self-heals concatenated payloads.

11
00:00:53.342 --> 00:00:58.742
Multi-tier terminal guards intercept heredoc file writes and raw file dumps before execution,

12
00:00:58.942 --> 00:01:03.842
preventing shell deadlocks while decoupling specialist token budgets from turn starvation.

13
00:01:04.168 --> 00:01:11.368
New in Phase 11: workspace-scoped dynamic project knowledge shares verified insights across stages via a Swarm Blackboard,

14
00:01:11.568 --> 00:01:15.368
automatically scrubbed against credential leaks.

15
00:01:15.568 --> 00:01:20.368
Manifest fingerprinting reactively invalidates environment caches on file edits.

16
00:01:20.568 --> 00:01:28.568
Supervised shells enforce view-epoch fencing, while surrogate-safe XML handoffs and two-phase reservations guarantee zero duplicate failovers.

17
00:01:28.876 --> 00:01:36.476
Every invariant is backed by real SQLite persistence, 20 Architecture Decision Records, and 19 blameless post-mortems.

18
00:01:36.676 --> 00:01:42.676
Verified across 952 automated tests with zero TypeScript or lint errors.

19
00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:48.976
LUMI Agent Swarm and The Legion: autonomous scale, cryptographic safety, and calm developer flow.
